 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "The strict w-local cover",
 "statement": "For a ring $A$, put $W=A^w$, let $I$ be the radical ideal defining its closed\npoint subset, whose closedness is proved in\n[lem-weil-pbc-w-localization-points], and set\n\n$$\n E=W^{\\mathrm e},\\qquad C_A=E_{[V(IE)]}.\n$$\n\nThe operations are those of [def-weil-pbc-w-localization],\n[def-weil-pbc-etale-contraction] and [def-weil-pbc-retained-localization].",
